@startuml system-overview
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowColor #2F3E46
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1B263B
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  FontColor #1B263B
}

title Auto-TZ System Overview

rectangle "User Browser" as user #EAF4FF
rectangle "Frontend\nReact + Vite + Tiptap\n(port 5173)" as fe #EAF4FF
rectangle "Backend API\nFastAPI + Dishka + Prisma\n(port 8000)" as api #E6FCF5
rectangle "Worker\nTaskIQ + LLM Pipeline + Parser + Export" as worker #FFF4E6

rectangle "RabbitMQ\nTask queue broker" as rabbit #FFF0F6
rectangle "Redis\nPub/Sub + TaskIQ result backend" as redis #F3F0FF
rectangle "PostgreSQL + pgvector\napplication + GKG data" as pg #EEF2FF
rectangle "SeaweedFS (S3)\nattachments / transcripts / exports" as s3 #EEF2FF
rectangle "LLM Providers\nOpenRouter / Ollama" as llm #FFF9DB

user --> fe : HTTP
fe --> api : REST API
fe <--> api : WebSocket /chat/ws

api --> rabbit : enqueue tasks
rabbit --> worker : deliver tasks

worker --> redis : publish events
api --> redis : subscribe for WS forwarding
api --> pg : ORM (Prisma)
worker --> pg : ORM + raw SQL (pgvector)

api --> s3 : upload/download attachments
worker --> s3 : parsed text + export files

worker --> llm : router/harvester/judge\nconsultant/architect calls

note bottom of fe
Frontend consumes events:
- PARSING_STATUS
- GENERATION_STATUS
- LLM_ANSWER
- EXPORT_READY
- ERROR
end note

note right of worker
Long-running operations:
- parse_file_task
- process_message_task
- create_tz_from_template_task
- update_tz_with_sources_task
- regenerate_block_task
- resolve_conflict_task
- export_tz_task
end note

@enduml
